<title>FINLAND: OSTRICH KILLED IN FINLAND CRASH.</title>
<headline>OSTRICH KILLED IN FINLAND CRASH.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>An ostrich was killed in a car crash in southern Finland on Thursday, police said.</p>
<p>The bird, travelling in a batch of 10 fresh imports, was run over by a land cruiser after it fell out of a truck, a spokeswoman said. The woman driving the cruiser was not hurt.</p>
<p>Elk are a common hazard on Finnish roads.</p>
</text>
